<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―The time had gone past 20:00.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, worn out from playing, had fallen asleep in <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE>'s futon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> was out shopping at the moment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still hadn't told <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> what <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> had said.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Two sets of footsteps came echoing along the outside walkway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It had to be <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and her daughter coming back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">iii!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment the door opened, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE> piled on top of <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> woke right up, and they started their wrestling match again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Welcome back, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm back. Where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"She went shopping."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> showed no particular expression.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She looked a little tired, but not as bad as yesterday.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, did you pull it off?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, just the way you wanted."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see. Thank you. I can't really repay you, but I'm grateful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">This was for the best. This way... surely..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s tired face clouded over even more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still couldn't believe <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had wanted a murder.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But for all that, it wasn't very noisy around here. Hasn't the incident come to light yet? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That's no good. You had to make sure the bodies were found right away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It's because they're found right away that you can stage an inexplicable incident..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Was that method your idea, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes, I thought it up. Nobody who didn't know the area could pull something like that off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">How was that drug? Was it as powerful as I expected?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"From the look of it, you managed to use it well without straining your body. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Apparently if you push it too hard, it can cause broken bones or heart </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="まひ">failure</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Who left the letter that was sent to Motoki-cho? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　You can tell me by now, can't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I left it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was at school, and while she was, I went back to Motoki-cho and slipped it into your mailbox."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You went to all that trouble so that we'd come here?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's right. If I'd met you two and you'd held me back, and I'd been stuck in Motoki-cho, I wouldn't have been able to go to today's memorial service. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Then I couldn't have manufactured my alibi, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see... Did 'someone I can trust' think that up?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No. That person only sent the supplies, and refused to help any further than that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">The rest of the plan―how we'd stay in contact and so on, I thought up all of it myself. Because I'm the one who knows what </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> two do."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"The dying together... you meant that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes. Otherwise I wouldn't have asked you for something like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then why did you propose a method like this, like people being spirited away? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Even if it's the Arata settlement's way, if anyone saw you, that getup would stand out way too much."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> turned her eyes toward <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and Natsumi.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two of them were playing around and didn't seem to pay any attention to our talk.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I gave </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> a book. A children's book of curses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Just as I expected, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> hid it from me and put a curse on those two to kill them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"This Megasawa City, you see, was a religious city until about 50 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And a new religion unique to Megasawa City, at that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But that religious group... I don't know the details, but apparently it caused a scandal. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">In the backlash, the people of Megasawa City now loathe that cult, and anything occult, too."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"And what does that have to do with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s curse...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Don't you see? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Loathing something means it's on your mind. In other words, you're conscious of it, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s curse becomes the trigger, the two get killed in some bizarre way, and everyone around thinks it's the occult, is that it?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's right. This Megasawa City hates the occult. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So if something occult happens, plenty of people should decide that's the cause. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">What the locals say eventually becomes public opinion."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But would steering people's minds like that really work...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Who knows. That I can't say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But it can't hurt, and if it works, I'm just lucky."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Even so, there was no need to have </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> cast a curse..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"To check </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s real feelings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s curse, if you watch what kind she casts, shows how seriously she's taking it, doesn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hold on! Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'ll believe she killed them herself...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Making her carry something that heavy...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's what </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> wished for herself, isn't it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Isn't granting that wish a parent's job?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Kh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think she had used even <STYLE ID="2">her own daughter</STYLE>'s mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's late to be saying this, but <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> really isn't in her right mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, if I tell her we did nothing today...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No. For now, I should draw out whatever information I can.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "42" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"By the way, that cult, what exactly..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's taboo here in Megasawa City, so I don't know the details. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But apparently the classmate </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> protected from the bullying comes from a family connected to that cult. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So the cult hasn't disappeared. It still exists today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">In other words, the people's minds aren't completely at ease."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"You said that cult had some connection to the Arata settlement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That was something I made up. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But there's a story that long ago, a faction that left the settlement took root in Megasawa. I heard it from </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">my mother-in-law</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> once. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I just forced a link to that."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"So, to steer the people of Megasawa City psychologically and throw the police investigation into confusion, you used the curse and that drug...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's right. That way the police can't get any proper testimony. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Well, as I said earlier, it's only a matter of being lucky if it works out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And besides, it really is movement no human could make."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"So making the police give up was also the aim..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Right. Nobody would think a human could leap 2 meters into the air, would they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Then today's results get reported to that person, I take it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I don't intend to report it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That person broke the settlement's </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too... so that person probably doesn't want to be too involved. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Even at the planning stage, that person only came to Megasawa once to talk."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"If it had failed... what would have happened? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Say, if we'd done nothing."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Nothing would have happened... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm sorry. Yesterday's was just a threat."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Then I'm glad..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? Glad...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "200" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> stuck her face into the box that held the weapons.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"What does this mean!? There's no sign they were used at all! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Did you do it some other way!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー怒り.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you be quiet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Faced with <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s sudden fury, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> froze where they stood.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "WAIT"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! What is the meaning of this!? Why didn't you do what I told you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s words, <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> fell silent for a moment.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... We couldn't do anything. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No, we didn't do anything..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"You two...! You understand what you've done, don't you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tool-box1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬ハンマー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With a face like a demon's, <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> took up the mace and edged closer, step by step.<PG>
{PLAYSND "忍び寄る影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, wait! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you don't really want this! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> too―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬ハンマーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Shut up! How dare you </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> me...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　You won't get away with this!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Stop it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Obachan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> clung to <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s leg.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why are you doing this!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Obachan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't like this! Go back to being the old </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Obachan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"L-let go! You'll get hurt!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s crying! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't want to see her </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> like this!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
